  "title": "Support Assistant Memory & Staged Rollout",
  "description": "# Support assistant with long-term memory and staged rollout\n\nA left-to-right system diagram with three flows: **live support turns** gather profile, transcript, and retrieved help content before guarded generation and credentialed actions; **conversation lifecycle** distills durable, traceable profile facts and archives expired raw transcripts; **staged rollout** samples versioned challengers against the champion, evaluates completed conversations, requires product-owner approval for promotion, and independently pulls regressions from traffic. The displaced champion remains available for one-step rollback.",
